# EMDR — use nura-ui-designer for UI/UX

When the task touches **UI, UX, layout, visual design, typography, spacing, components, pages, modals, empty states, marketing sections, onboarding, auth chrome, sidebar, header, or admin visuals**:

1. **Read and follow** `.cursor/skills/nura-ui-designer/SKILL.md` before designing or coding UI.
2. Explicit invoke: `/nura-ui-designer` or “nura-ui-designer”.
3. Still obey `nura-brand`, `product-ui`, `page-copy-design-review`, and `verify-before-done`.
4. Do **not** use the retired `apple-ui` skill or Apple HIG / Inter / `#007AFF` for Nura product work.
5. **Fraunces** = marketing hero / major landing section titles only. Never on `/app`, `/admin`, or legal/long-form (`/terms`, `/privacy`) — those use Source Sans 3.
